 "scenes": [
  {
   "id": "problem",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 18.462,
   "bars": 8,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "It's Monday morning, in Singapore.",
     "file": "vo2/00-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 0.7,
     "dur": 2.251
    },
    {
     "text": "Maya runs a sales team of six. Hundreds of leads. No time.",
     "file": "vo2/00-1.wav",
     "rel": 3.301,
     "start": 3.301,
     "dur": 4.942
    },
    {
     "text": "Leads go cold in the CRM. Research eats the whole morning.",
     "file": "vo2/00-2.wav",
     "rel": 8.593,
     "start": 8.593,
     "dur": 4.055
    },
    {
     "text": "And nobody is sure, which companies are even real.",
     "file": "vo2/00-3.wav",
     "rel": 12.998,
     "start": 12.998,
     "dur": 3.221
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "reveal",
   "start": 18.462,
   "end": 27.692,
   "bars": 4,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Meet Sales Mama.",
     "file": "vo2/01-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 19.162,
     "dur": 1.124
    },
    {
     "text": "An AI sales harness, that runs inside Claude Code. The repo is the system.",
     "file": "vo2/01-1.wav",
     "rel": 2.174,
     "start": 20.636,
     "dur": 5.19
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "overnight",
   "start": 27.692,
   "end": 39.231,
   "bars": 5,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "At two a.m., scouts scan news, tenders and registries.",
     "file": "vo2/02-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 28.392,
     "dur": 4.151
    },
    {
     "text": "Every lead is scored. And a virtual account manager watches every book.",
     "file": "vo2/02-1.wav",
     "rel": 5.201,
     "start": 32.893,
     "dur": 4.256
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "manager",
   "start": 39.231,
   "end": 50.769,
   "bars": 5,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "At eight thirty, the manager opens the cockpit.",
     "file": "vo2/03-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 39.931,
     "dur": 2.783
    },
    {
     "text": "Last night's run. The hot accounts. And a fair allocation, approved in one click.",
     "file": "vo2/03-1.wav",
     "rel": 3.833,
     "start": 43.063,
     "dur": 5.933
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rep",
   "start": 50.769,
   "end": 62.308,
   "bars": 5,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Reps type, mama day.",
     "file": "vo2/04-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 51.469,
     "dur": 1.589
    },
    {
     "text": "Replies are triaged. New accounts are researched in parallel. And drafts are written in their own voice.",
     "file": "vo2/04-1.wav",
     "rel": 2.639,
     "start": 53.409,
     "dur": 6.355
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "grounded",
   "start": 62.308,
   "end": 69.231,
   "bars": 3,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Every fact links back to its source. No source, no claim.",
     "file": "vo2/05-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 63.008,
     "dur": 4.413
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "send",
   "start": 69.231,
   "end": 83.077,
   "bars": 6,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "In the send window, mama send shows the whole batch.",
     "file": "vo2/06-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 69.931,
     "dur": 3.065
    },
    {
     "text": "The rep picks, approves once, and Sales Mama sends email and WhatsApp, logging every touch.",
     "file": "vo2/06-1.wav",
     "rel": 4.115,
     "start": 73.345,
     "dur": 5.965
    },
    {
     "text": "Nothing goes out, without approval.",
     "file": "vo2/06-2.wav",
     "rel": 10.429,
     "start": 79.66,
     "dur": 2.124
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "check",
   "start": 83.077,
   "end": 101.538,
   "bars": 8,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Before anyone sells, company check asks: is this company real?",
     "file": "vo2/07-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 83.777,
     "dur": 4.632
    },
    {
     "text": "Live with ACRA. Filing on time. A real office, not a virtual one. And more than three staff.",
     "file": "vo2/07-1.wav",
     "rel": 5.682,
     "start": 88.759,
     "dur": 6.95
    },
    {
     "text": "Three verifier agents, gather the evidence.",
     "file": "vo2/07-2.wav",
     "rel": 12.983,
     "start": 96.06,
     "dur": 2.96
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "insights",
   "start": 101.538,
   "end": 113.077,
   "bars": 5,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Ask a question. Get a report.",
     "file": "vo2/08-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 102.238,
     "dur": 2.356
    },
    {
     "text": "Nine thousand six hundred clinics. Ninety-three percent filing on time. And the best new leads.",
     "file": "vo2/08-1.wav",
     "rel": 3.406,
     "start": 104.945,
     "dur": 6.625
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "guardrails",
   "start": 113.077,
   "end": 122.308,
   "bars": 4,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Guardrails are built in. Approvals, citations, suppression lists, and rules for every market.",
     "file": "vo2/09-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 113.777,
     "dur": 6.773
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "outro",
   "start": 122.308,
   "end": 131.538,
   "bars": 4,
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Sales Mama.",
     "file": "vo2/10-0.wav",
     "rel": 0.7,
     "start": 123.008,
     "dur": 0.911
    },
    {
     "text": "Your sales team's morning, done before coffee.",
     "file": "vo2/10-1.wav",
